  "title": "Evaluate a persisted prepared assignment program",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Evaluate a persisted prepared assignment program",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The real authoring producer stores named inputs [x,z,q] and outputs [p,y] with its AST. Values [3,4,5] produce [25,10] without reparsing the original source text at execution.\n\nThe real authoring producer stores named inputs [x,z,q] and outputs [p,y] with its AST. Values [3,4,5] produce [25,10] without reparsing the original source text at execution.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.formula.evaluation@1; compiled owned-value service.\nExpected:\noutput-output_values (array<f64>) = [25,10]\noutput-error (cluster<\"status\":bool,\"code\":i32,\"source\":string>) = {\"status\":false,\"code\":0,\"source\":\"\"}\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["formula", "native", "typed", "independent-oracle", "example"],
    "documentation_uri": ""
  },
