        "id": "example-explanation",
        "kind": "comment",
        "comment_auto_size": false,
        "text": "Evaluate a persisted prepared assignment program\nThe real authoring producer stores named inputs [x,z,q] and outputs [p,y] with its AST. Values [3,4,5] produce [25,10] without reparsing the original source text at execution.\nEntrées -> opération -> indicateurs. Résultat attendu : output-output_values (array<f64>) = [25,10]\noutput-error (cluster<\"status\":bool,\"code\":i32,\"source\":string>) = {\"status\":false,\"code\":0,\"source\":\"\"}\n",
